# Documentation

Docs site uses Nextra in `docs/pages/`.

## When to update

If you change CLI behavior, config schema, or flags, also update:

- Relevant page in `docs/pages/` (cli, jobs, config, pipelines)
- `cmd/config.example.yaml`

## Structure

- CLI commands: `docs/pages/cli/`
- Job types: `docs/pages/jobs/`
- Config reference: `docs/pages/config.md`
- Pipelines: `docs/pages/pipelines.md`

## New pages

When adding a new doc page, update the corresponding `_meta.json` in that directory.
